WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:05.760
You’ve got the fundamentals down, now let’s
look at network infrastructure.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.360
To successfully run a network, you need to
know what type of network you are in, which

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.559
standards are being used, and which topologies
are being used.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:20.359
Topologies are both physical and logical,
and you can have different topologies in a

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:22.259
network, as you will see next.

